  "description": "Demolition of existing rear extension to allow for the\r\nerection of a single storey rear extension, lowering of\r\nexisting basement level including enlargement of rear\r\nlightwell and external steps to rear garden. Relocation of\r\nexisting roofwindows and addition of new windows to\r\nside and rear elevations of the house",
