  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (WPG-P-A-A.00 and construction method statement- received 15/05/20\r\nWPG-P-A-A.01 B, WPG-P-A-A.02 B, WPG-P-A-A.03 B, WPG-P-A-A.04 B, WPG-P-A-A.05 B, WPG-P-A-A.06 B, WPG-P-A-A.11 B, WPG-P-A-A.12 B, WPG-P-A-A.13 B, WPG-P-A-A.21 B, WPG-P-A-A.22 B, WPG-P-A-A.23 B, WPG-P-A-A.24 B, WPG-P-A-A.25 B and design and access statement- received 08/07/20) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 4 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of 8:00am  to 6:00pm on Mondays to Friday and 9 :00am to 1:00pm on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays and Public Holidays without the prior agreement of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 5 - The windows formed in first floor side the elevation shall be obscure glazed, hinged to open inwards and shall not be repaired or replaced otherwise than with obscured glazing.",
    "Condition : 6 - The roof lights shall be 'conservation style', installed to be flush with the existing roof slope.",
    "Condition : 7 - The basement hereby permitted shall at no time be used or occupied as a separate dwelling independent of the main house and shall not be used as sleeping accommodation.",
    "Condition : 8 - No excavation or construction work shall be undertaken prior to the submission and approval in writing by the Local Planning Authority, of a Construction Method Statement, which is certified by a qualified professional giving details of excavation, temporary works and construction techniques, including details of potential impacts on neighbouring land based on assessment of the geology and hydrology of the area. The basement extension should be carried in accordance with the details approved."
  ],
